      "module_name": "Mathlib.Analysis.Analytic.Order",
      "kind": "theorem",
      "type": "∀ {𝕜 : Type u_1} {E : Type u_2} [inst : NontriviallyNormedField 𝕜] [inst_1 : NormedAddCommGroup E]\n  [inst_2 : NormedSpace 𝕜 E] {f : 𝕜 → E} {x : 𝕜},\n  AnalyticAt 𝕜 f x →\n    ∀ [CompleteSpace E] [CharZero 𝕜], analyticOrderAt (deriv f) x + 1 = analyticOrderAt (fun x_1 => f x_1 - f x) x"
